# Ruta 8 (C4a, contract 39), 34 x 16. column = i, row = j. Pueblo Bruma arrives at the EAST edge (i = 33, rows 7..8); the road runs west past the passage hut (door (15,5), the second underground
# passage to Ruta 7) to the CLOSED GATE of Ciudad Cenit (the gatehouse across the road at (2..3,7..8) and its guard: Cenit opens in chapter 6). Look (the user's mock "Rutas 7 y 8"): the city OUTSKIRTS: an asphalt road
# (a mix of plain and dashed-lane tiles), a sidewalk on both sides, chain-link fences, road signs, street lamps, mowed lawn with tall-grass patches. Four trainers (two gamblers, a lass, a mechanic) watch the road.
@map ruta_8
@size 34 16
@interior no
@area ruta_8
@flag cenit_gates 837   # a guard got a drink: every gate of Ciudad Cenit is open (contract 49)
@bg 0
@fill lawn
@spawn east 32 7 W
@spawn hut_door 15 6 S
@encounters grass rate=20
  cindermeer 21 25 25   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  ramplet 21 25 15   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  lullabun 21 25 20
  mossbud 21 25 20
  lunelle 21 24 5
  mothmist 21 25 10   # C6 (contract 49): around Ciudad Cenit (the evolved one, rare, only here)
  veilmoth 24 27 5
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, normal route): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 4 (4/256 per step).
@open_rate 4
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@spawn cenit 1 7 SE
@legend
  .  tile=lawn
  a  object=chain_i
  b  object=chain_j
  c  object=dry_bush
  d  object=house_f
  e  tile=tall_grass
  f  npc=chica id=t3 face=S trainer=chica_r8 range=3 text=tr.chica_r8.pre after=tr.chica_r8.after
  g  object=lamp_h
  h  npc=jugador id=t1 face=S trainer=jugador_r8a range=3 text=tr.jugador_r8a.pre after=tr.jugador_r8a.after
  i  door=house_f
  j  object=road_sign text=ruta8.hut.sign interact=look
  k  tile=sidewalk object=chain_j
  l  tile=sidewalk
  m  tile=sidewalk object=road_sign text=ruta8.gate.sign interact=look
  n  tile=asph object=chain_j
  o  tile=asph
  p  tile=asph object=gatehouse
  q  tile=asph npc=guardia id=guard2 face=W script=gate_guard2 show_flag=cenit_gates   # the guard's friend, aside once the gates are open
  r  tile=asph
  s  tile=tall_grass npc=mecanico id=t4 face=N trainer=mecanico_r8 range=3 text=tr.mecanico_r8.pre after=tr.mecanico_r8.after
  t  tile=tall_grass npc=jugador id=t2 face=N trainer=jugador_r8b range=3 text=tr.jugador_r8b.pre after=tr.jugador_r8b.after
  u  item=rich_salve
  v  item=luna
  W  tile=asph                        # the lane into Ciudad Cenit (east gate)
  U  tile=asph npc=guardia id=guard face=SE script=gate_guard hide_flag=cenit_gates gate=yes   # the thirsty guard
  H  tile=lawn hidden=prime_salve   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  b..bH............................b
  b..b.............................b
  b..b..aaaaaaa.......aaaaaaaaaaa..b
  b..bpp....c...dd......eeeee.f..c.b
  b..bpp..g.h...di.j..g.eeeee....g.b
  klkklmllllllllllllllllllllllllllll
  WoooUqooooooooooooooooooooooooooor
  nonnooooooooooooooooooooooooooooor
  klkkllllllllllllllllllllllllllllll
  b..b.......g...........g.........b
  b..b.eeese...c...eeeeet.......c..b
  b..bueeeee.c.....eeeeee...c......b
  b..b.eeeee.......eeeeee.......v..b
  b..b.............................b
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@warp i -> pasadizo2_n spawn=door
@warp r -> pueblo_bruma spawn=west
@warp W -> ciudad_cenit_sur spawn=east
# The thirsty guard: ANY drink of the Neon store opens all the gates (flag 837); he walks aside and his friend (show_flag) greets the hero.
@script gate_guard npc
    npc_face_hero guard
    jnf badge_toxina nobadge
    say cenit.guard.thirsty
    has_item spring_water 0
    jv 0 1 d_water
    has_item fizzy_pop 0
    jv 0 1 d_soda
    has_item citrus_cooler 0
    jv 0 1 d_lemon
    say cenit.guard.none
    end
  d_water:
    item_var 0 spring_water
    take_item spring_water 1
    jmp thanks
  d_soda:
    item_var 0 fizzy_pop
    take_item fizzy_pop 1
    jmp thanks
  d_lemon:
    item_var 0 citrus_cooler
    take_item citrus_cooler 1
  thanks:
    sfx item
    say cenit.guard.give
    say cenit.guard.open
    npc_walk guard SE 1
    npc_face guard NW
    setf cenit_gates
    end
  nobadge:
    say cenit.guard.badge
    end
@end
@script gate_guard2 npc
    npc_face_hero guard2
    say cenit.guard.after
@end

